00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.070
<b>Bertrand!</b>

00:01:59.070 --> 00:02:00.470
<b>Lord Mashas!</b>

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:10.820
<b>It was a terrible...</b>

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.230
<b>battle...</b>

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.800
<b>That was a war maiden.</b>

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.510
<b>Going by the sound, I'd say I've got five left.</b>

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.600
<b>A Brune survivor!</b>

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.530
<b>Aw, man.</b>

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.520
<b>I wanted the horse to ride on.</b>

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:00.780
<b>Seven of them?</b>

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.200
<b>That hair—she's a war maiden.</b>

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.050
<b>If I can take out their leader,</b>

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:12.070
<b>they'll have bigger worries
than chasing us down.</b>

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:12.920
<b>All right...</b>

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:19.010
<b>Range is three hundred alsins.</b>

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.000
<b>I can do this.</b>

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:35.020
<b>Eris, goddess of wind and storms...</b>

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.020
<b>Drop your weapon.</b>

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:42.350
<b>Between the Kingdoms of Brune and Zhcted lie the Dinant Plains,</b>

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:47.100
<b>where a major battle between the two countries was about to take place.</b>

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:52.260
<b>Their overwhelming superiority of numbers filled the Brune soldiers with confidence.</b>

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:56.330
<b>Not a single one of them thought they could possibly lose.</b>

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.190
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:06.360
<b>Huh? You're here, too, are you,</b>

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.630
<b>Vorn?</b>

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:15.050
<b>I am honored to meet the
renowned Lord Zion Thenardier.</b>

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.880
<b>I, too, have been called on
as one of His Majesty's—</b>

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.160
<b>Such a meek way of answering me.</b>

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.170
<b>What good is having <i>you</i>
here supposed to do?</b>

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:26.220
<b>Look at how downright
shabby this guy is dressed!</b>

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.500
<b>Leather armor!</b>

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:30.050
<b>You're a nobleman; don't you own some decent armor?</b>

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.650
<b>A bow, huh?</b>

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:36.140
<b>I'll show you!</b>

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:41.900
<b>Are you hurt, Lord?</b>

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.440
<b>What were you going to do
if my bow got bent?!</b>

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.700
<b>Your bow?!</b>

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:48.010
<b>A bow is the weapon of a coward!</b>

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:51.700
<b>Honestly,</b>

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:56.780
<b>you're only obsessing over your bow because you can't handle a sword or spear.</b>

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:58.710
<b>You're just here to play soldier.</b>

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:03.290
<b>Your only attendant is some old man. 
Such a disgrace.</b>

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:09.850
<b>A count of the Kingdom of Brune should be training daily—</b>

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:11.330
<b>Lord Zion...</b>

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:14.490
<b>I am sure your eloquent speech</b>

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:17.520
<b>has made you quite thirsty, hasn't it?</b>

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:20.230
<b>Wine is now being distributed to the soldiers.</b>

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.230
<b><i>Please</i>, go and drink a cup.</b>

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.990
<b>Thank you very much, Lord Mashas.</b>

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.320
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:34.830
<b>I was trying to walk the high road, but couldn't stop myself.</b>

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:37.020
<b>Luckily you got me out of it.</b>

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:40.070
<b>I envy Duke Ganelon.</b>

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.330
<b>Huh? For what?</b>

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.020
<b>This war gave him the
perfect excuse to raise taxes.</b>

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:46.400
<b>And if you don't pay up, 
your daughter's off to the castle.</b>

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:50.400
<b>Heard the same. 
And Lord Thenardier is forcing his subjects</b>

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.190
<b>to give away their liquor
"as a pledge to the gods".</b>

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.290
<b>Both of them are burning down the houses of those who refuse.</b>

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:01.200
<b>By the way, I heard Lord Thenardier is also forcing family members</b>

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:04.030
<b>to kill one another in duels
as examples to others.</b>

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.730
<b>Sounds like a good time.</b>

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:15.060
<b>Take it easy.</b>

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.160
<b>Are those things really happening?</b>

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.120
<b>Those lords wouldn't even deny it.</b>

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:24.130
<b>I guess you're out of the loop since you haven't visited the capital for a while.</b>

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.170
<b>His Majesty...</b>

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.550
<b>His Majesty has a plan, I'm sure.</b>

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.630
<b>A plan?</b>

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:34.950
<b>Even if His Majesty won't do something, Regnas will, in time, surely—</b>

00:07:47.350 --> 00:07:49.280
<b>Are you finally awake?</b>

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.680
<b>Is it morning?</b>

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.080
<b>It's noon already.</b>

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.830
<b>That's an unusual way
of waking someone up...</b>

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.890
<b>It was my first time too—</b>

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:01.430
<b>I don't usually have to go <i>this</i> far to wake people up.</b>

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:07.490
<b>But seriously, you must be the
only prisoner who can sleep so soundly.</b>

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.240
<b>I guess it's a special talent of mine.</b>

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.690
<b>Let's see.</b>

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.870
<b>I'm in Zhcted, aren't I?</b>

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.050
<b>Lady Eleonora is calling for you.</b>

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.060
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:22.560
<b>Wh-What do you mean, captured?</b>

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.620
<b>Our forces were routed during an enemy surprise attack.</b>

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.360
<b>Tigre did not get away in time and was taken prisoner.</b>

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:32.930
<b>B-But you outnumbered the enemy five to one.</b>

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:35.440
<b>There's no way you could have lost, is there?</b>

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.370
<b>True,</b>

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:40.770
<b>our twenty-five thousand men faced
an enemy force of about five thousand.</b>

00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:45.120
<b>Since this was Prince Regnas' first campaign, His Majesty assembled a huge army.</b>

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.670
<b>His Majesty was asking too much of Lord Tigre.</b>

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.650
<b>He barely managed to scrape
together the required hundred men.</b>

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.350
<b>Of those hundred,</b>

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:55.880
<b>seven are dead and thirty are injured.</b>

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:00.450
<b>Mostly because their fleeing allies trampled them.</b>

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.890
<b>This is what the enemy leader wrote:</b>

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:07.360
<b>Unless Tigre's ransom is delivered to Zhcted within fifty days,</b>

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.580
<b>he will become their property.</b>

00:09:09.580 --> 00:09:10.900
<b>How much is it?</b>

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:14.440
<b>Even if it's a lot, as long as everyone in the village helps...</b>

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.280
<b>They're asking for a sum three times as large as Alsace's tax income</b>

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.880
<b>or something of comparable value.</b>

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.710
<b>That's too much. Bring it down some.</b>

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:26.870
<b>No.</b>

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:33.900
<b>The sum has to be paid within fifty days of us delivering our demands to the Kingdom of Brune.</b>

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:38.000
<b>If I don't receive the ransom in time,
you will officially enter my property.</b>

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:41.220
<b>Those terms were laid down in our treaty with the Kingdom of Brune.</b>

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:44.900
<b>We swore this by Radegast, god of honor and contracts.</b>

00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:50.340
<b>So, you stuck a sword in my mouth and dragged me here</b>

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.740
<b>just to make me listen to this outrageous talk?</b>

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.610
<b>Now, now, of course
that wasn't the only reason.</b>

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.680
<b>I also have a special favor to ask of you.</b>

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.070
<b>And the second shot's way off mark too!</b>

00:10:12.070 --> 00:10:14.200
<b>Are you taking this seriously?</b>

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.550
<b>Sure am.</b>

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.070
<b>Well, I could always take over for him!</b>

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.550
<b>Rurick, that's harsh.</b>

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:24.030
<b>Why would the war maiden
take this guy prisoner?</b>

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:26.180
<b>Hey, look, he's still at it.</b>

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.390
<b>He's going to embarrass 
himself even more, isn't he?</b>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.700
<b>This is such a ridiculous farce.</b>

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.880
<b>The first shot was too short.
 The second one was way off the mark.</b>

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:38.110
<b>Our precious count must be
coming down with something.</b>

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.340
<b>I've gotten the feel of the bow now.</b>

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:45.080
<b>All right...</b>

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.290
<b>Look out!</b>

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.670
<b>Get down!</b>

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.920
<b>Arifar...</b>

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.140
<b>Seize that rebel!</b>

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:06.650
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.730
<b>Will they take him alive?</b>

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.370
<b>That'd be way too risky!</b>

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.140
<b>All right. I'll shoot his foot.</b>

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.450
<b>What the...?! With that crude bow?!</b>

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.210
<b>We're over three hundred alsins away from the range!</b>

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:42.060
<b>I'll ask just in case:
should I continue target shooting?</b>

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.640
<b>No, that's fine.</b>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:52.020
<b>You did well, Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

