<b>About the bow you were given.</b>

00:12:15.770 --> 00:12:19.130
<b>I never would've thought
they'd give you one that bad.</b>

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.550
<b>Hm, so not all Zhcted bows
are that poorly made?</b>

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:26.870
<b>Three soldiers hatched
that scheme and carried it out.</b>

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:28.120
<b>I'll behead them, so—</b>

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.060
<b>Wait a second!</b>

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:32.430
<b>You don't have to go <i>that</i> far.</b>

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:35.670
<b>They were trying to
make a fool out of you,</b>

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.880
<b>to publicly dishonor and humiliate you.</b>

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.610
<b>It's only fair they pay
with their lives for that.</b>

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:46.510
<b>Would you please
forgive them this one time?</b>

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:50.120
<b>But only this once.</b>

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:55.980
<b>B-By the way, what was the point of yesterday's practice?</b>

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.420
<b>Well...</b>

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.790
<b>You, a war maiden,
fell for me at first sight?!</b>

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:07.760
<b>That's right.</b>

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:09.550
<b>People seem to love speculating</b>

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:12.370
<b>about battlefield romances and gossip about enemies becoming lovers.</b>

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:15.500
<b>And there's rumors like that about us too.</b>

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.890
<b>Then again, it's not like they're completely off the mark.</b>

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.830
<b>The falling-for part is true.</b>

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.860
<b>For me?</b>

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:25.140
<b>For your skill with the bow.</b>

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.600
<b>Sorry to tell you,
but I don't love you yourself.</b>

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:33.260
<b>Anyway, some of my men overreacted after hearing those stories.</b>

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.950
<b>To keep the rumors from spreading,
they want me to kill you.</b>

00:13:39.740 --> 00:13:43.670
<b>A notion I wholeheartedly agree with.</b>

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.990
<b>Everyone shared her attitude.</b>

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:48.060
<b>I thought showing them your skills would be</b>

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:49.930
<b>the quickest way to make them stop.</b>

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.430
<b>It worked better than I could've hoped.</b>

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:57.010
<b>Oh, yeah. Let me add this:</b>

00:13:57.010 --> 00:14:01.440
<b>It wasn't the potential ransom money
that made me take you prisoner at Dinant.</b>

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:05.350
<b>If I had to give a reason, I'd say it was
because I found you entertaining.</b>

00:14:05.350 --> 00:14:07.450
<b>Entertaining? Me?</b>

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.180
<b>All in all, it was a terrible battle.</b>

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.080
<b>One of the most boring I ever fought.</b>

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:24.180
<b>The enemy outnumbered our
five thousand soldiers five to one.</b>

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.810
<b>I expected a brutal battle.</b>

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.980
<b>Charge!</b>

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.520
<b>But half a day was all it took to wipe out Brune's forces.</b>

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.530
<b>Why are you complaining
about an easy victory?</b>

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.740
<b>I had come up with several
excellent battle plans!</b>

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:55.950
<b>And yet, your side collapsed during
my first one, and were routed by us!</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.250
<b>Your first plan?</b>

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.870
<b>You mean the late-night surprise attack?</b>

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.390
<b>True enough, we did scout out the area ahead of time,</b>

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:06.540
<b>but it was still too easy to disrupt the enemy
rear guard, break through, and split their army.</b>

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:08.890
<b>On top of that, we took the head of the Brune prince.</b>

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:10.990
<b>Prince Regnas?</b>

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.320
<b>Were you close?</b>

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.260
<b>No way.</b>

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:16.450
<b>I only ever met him once.</b>

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.960
<b>Will this become a problem?</b>

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:21.620
<b>It's what happens on the battlefield.</b>

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:24.660
<b>I myself killed some Zhcted soldiers.</b>

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.690
<b>I see.</b>

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.540
<b>Once the news of his death spread,</b>

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:32.620
<b>the whole Brune force collapsed.</b>

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:41.850
<b>The enemy broke rank and fled, 
so we attacked them from behind.</b>

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:43.490
<b>We literally ran them over.</b>

00:15:43.490 --> 00:15:46.340
<b>It was anticlimactic. 
I was thoroughly disappointed.</b>

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:50.090
<b>And that's when I met you!</b>

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:58.130
<b>I thought it'd be a shame to kill you.</b>

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:02.460
<b>You amazed me.
Despite everything, you were still fighting.</b>

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.110
<b>You tried to kill me, calmly and deliberately.</b>

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.100
<b>I really liked that.</b>

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:10.680
<b>That's why I brought
you here to Leitmeritz—</b>

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:11.110
<b>Hm?</b>

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:14.350
<b>Is that why you don't like him? 
Could you be holding a grudge, Lim?</b>

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:18.240
<b>That is completely unrelated.</b>

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.250
<b>Still haven't figured it out yet?</b>

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:25.260
<b>Back on the battlefield,
the first horse you shot was Lim's.</b>

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.250
<b>Limalisha.</b>

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.260
<b>Once again, I am pleased to meet you,</b>

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.260
<b>Count Tigrevurmud Vorn.</b>

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.940
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.100
<b>Come to think of it, your name...</b>

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.760
<b>It's pretty long for a Bruneman.</b>

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.920
<b>Where does it come from?</b>

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:45.240
<b>I was named after one of my ancestors.</b>

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.650
<b>If it's too hard for you to say,
you can call me Tigre.</b>

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.590
<b>In that case, you can call me Elen!</b>

00:16:50.590 --> 00:16:51.290
<b>I'm more used to—</b>

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.830
<b>Lady Eleonora!</b>

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.370
<b>Why don't you serve under me?</b>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.980
<b>I will bestow upon you the
same titles as you had in Brune.</b>

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:07.610
<b>And in battle I will treat you the same as
my men, regardless of you being a Bruneman.</b>

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.380
<b>No thanks.</b>

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.360
<b>I appreciate the offer, though.</b>

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:16.710
<b>No one in the Kingdom of Brune
would treat a prisoner this way.</b>

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.320
<b>Then why are you turning it down?</b>

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:22.990
<b>There already is a place
for me to return to and protect.</b>

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:26.110
<b>Alsace.</b>

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.970
<b>It's the county I inherited from my father.</b>

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:40.490
<b>Lord Tigre, please be all right.</b>

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:49.680
<b>Listen, if I were you,
I'd stop shaving my head.</b>

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:53.330
<b>Your shiny dome seems to be ruining
your good looks more and more by the minute.</b>

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:56.630
<b>Let me tell you again!</b>

00:17:56.630 --> 00:18:02.550
<b>I was ordered by the war maiden to sacrifice whatever is most important to me!</b>

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:04.900
<b>Truly, I should be dead by now,</b>

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.790
<b>but thanks to your benevolence,
Lord Tigrevurmud, I am still alive.</b>

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:10.620
<b>Keeping my head shaven is the least I can do!</b>

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:16.910
<b>Besides, I was genuinely inspired
by your miraculous skill with a bow.</b>

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.830
<b>I'm ashamed of how incompetent I am in comparison!</b>

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.910
<b>Uh, yeah...</b>

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.910
<b>So please, do not bring this up again!</b>

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.540
<b>O-Okay, just stand up! Sorry I asked!</b>

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.180
<b>There they go again.</b>

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:29.180
<b>Master Rurick never does things halfway.</b>

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:34.430
<b>Still, Lord Tigrevurmud's skill
with a bow is something else, huh?</b>

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.300
<b>It sure is.</b>

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.470
<b>No matter how many
times I eat it, it's delicious.</b>

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.920
<b>You really are an odd one.</b>

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.980
<b>What's so special about the
standard rations given to us soldiers?</b>

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.560
<b>That's the great part!</b>

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.490
<b>Once I get back to Alsace,
I'll have Titta cook this for me.</b>

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.340
<b>How does he hit the target with three arrows at once?</b>

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.200
<b>That's awesome!</b>

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:10.180
<b>Tigre! Please give me another archery lesson sometime!</b>

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:11.220
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.210
<b>I'm fitting right in, huh?</b>

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:30.210
<b>Even so, I'm still very much a prisoner.</b>

00:19:40.590 --> 00:19:43.770
<b>A dragon pup? 
I've never seen one before!</b>

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.960
<b>That's Lunie, my pet dragon.</b>

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:54.020
<b>Hey.</b>

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:01.970
<b>I-I'm sorry!</b>

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:05.520
<b>I... discovered this place
when I was taking a walk earlier.</b>

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:09.040
<b>It didn't look like anyone
would be using it, so... that is...</b>

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:11.070
<b>You don't have to apologize.</b>

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.450
<b>You came here to wash yourself, right?</b>

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:19.240
<b>Don't stand there with your back to me. 
Come on over.</b>

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.160
<b>Then, um...</b>

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.650
<b>in Zhcted... you know,</b>

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:27.720
<b>men and women bathe together?</b>

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.120
<b>No, of course not.</b>

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.800
<b>And this is awkward for me too.</b>

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:35.630
<b>But I am a war maiden.</b>

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.000
<b>So even if I'm taken by surprise, seen naked,</b>

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.610
<b>and feel like I could die from embarrassment,</b>

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:43.950
<b>I can't cower in a corner like a little girl, now can I?</b>

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.710
<b>I want you.</b>

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.760
<b>It's so peaceful here.</b>

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.050
<b>"I want you," huh?</b>

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.760
<b>We've captured an old man
with a Brunish accent.</b>

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.770
<b>Bertrand!</b>

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:29.760
<b>Young Lord!</b>

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.020
<b>Thank goodness you're safe!</b>

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.870
<b>I could say the same!</b>

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.750
<b>So you actually know him?</b>

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.380
<b>Thanks, everyone!</b>

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.810
<b>Bertrand has been my attendant for ages!</b>

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:42.760
<b>Young Lord, we have no time for this.</b>

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:47.450
<b>Duke Thenardier's force
is marching on Alsace!</b>

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:49.570
<b>They're numbering three thousand!</b>

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:50.950
<b>They're what?!</b>

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:54.860
<b>Please come back, Lord Tigrevurmud!</b>

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.050
<b>Where do you think you're going at this time of day?</b>

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.480
<b>Please let me pass.</b>

